# Slime Against Humanity counts cards you OWN (CR 108.3): Bot1 exiles Bot2's Primordial Ooze with Swords to Plowshares, which is an Ooze in exile that Bot2 owns,
# and Bot1's own Swords to Plowshares sits in Bot1's graveyard (not an Ooze): X stays 2 and the Ooze token is 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swords to Plowshares
Slime Against Humanity
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Primordial Ooze
Mountain x18

